here. They are not part of this repository and no claim is made about them.

Scope and exclusions
--------------------

This repository contains templates and code only. It does not contain, and must
not contain:

  - Feishu app credentials (app_id / app_secret) or bot tokens
  - Local configuration instances (config/ctl.conf, config/stream.conf,
    config/feishu-app.json, config/dsh-host.json)
  - Runtime state, logs, delivery queues, or received images
  - Session transcripts, conversation IDs, or task titles from any real machine
  - Screenshots containing personal or organizational content

Users generate their own local configuration from the provided .example templates.
See the repository structure section in README.md.

